  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Insulated Hunting Gloves are your essential companion for maintaining dexterity in cold weather during outdoor pursuits and activities. Built with durable 55% cotton / 45% polyester blend, these gloves are designed to withstand extreme cold weather conditions, ensuring your hands stay warm and comfortable while you focus on the hunt.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
