  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Insulated Hunting Gloves are your essential companion for maintaining dexterity in cold weather during outdoor pursuits and activities. Built with durable 55% cotton / 45% polyester blend, these gloves are designed to withstand extreme cold weather conditions, ensuring your hands stay warm and comfortable while you focus on the hunt. Featuring Thermoblock insulation, they provide superior warmth and keep your hands dry even in the harshest environments. The leather palm enhances grip and dexterity, allowing you to handle your gear with precision. Available in a variety of colors, these gloves offer versatility to match your hunting gear or personal preference. Whether you're stalking through the woods or waiting in a blind, these insulated gloves provide the protection and flexibility you need for a successful hunt. Trust Rothco to keep you warm and agile during your outdoor adventures.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
